8,"Areal features in Gongduk, Bjokapakha and Black Mountain Mönpa...",https://benjamins.com/catalog/ltba.18015.ger,The similarities between Gongduk and Bjokapakha indicate a situation of areal convergence of recent data. This contact scenario explains certain aberrancies of Bjokapakha with regard to other Tshangla varieties.,Gongduk,Sino-Tibetan
